<title>EGYPT: Egypt offers 91-day T-bills worth 800 mln pounds. [corrected 07:38 gmt]</title>
<headline>Egypt offers 91-day T-bills worth 800 mln pounds. [corrected 07:38 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian treasury offered 91-day treasury bills worth 800 million pounds for auction on January 29 and issue on January 30 when 91-day bills worth 855.225 (corrects from 85.2255) million pounds mature.</p>
<p>The average yield at the last auction was 10.014 percent.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.40 Egyptian pounds)</p>
</text>
